# pos-lite CODEOWNERS — drives merge gating + audit-team auto-watch.
# The AI Reviewer's path-based signal layer reads its own rule set internally;
# this file controls GitHub's structural enforcement (branch protection).
#
# Format reminder (GitHub): <pattern>  <owner1> <owner2> ...
# Branch-protection rules require approvals from listed CODEOWNERS for
# matching paths. The audit role is added as a parallel observer — its
# review request fires automatically but isn't required to merge.
#
# Demo note: the @<team>/* placeholders below illustrate the production
# shape (org/team-scoped CODEOWNERS). For the live demo, @kenny-techsolution
# is added on protected paths so branch protection has a real owner to
# require an approval from.

# ---------- Tier 3 paths (PCI / payments / auth / KYC / crypto) ----------
# Real owners gate merge:
/api/payments/**         @kenny-techsolution
/api/auth/**             @kenny-techsolution
/api/kyc/**              @kenny-techsolution
/api/crypto/**           @kenny-techsolution

# In production these would map to org-scoped teams, illustrative below:
#   /api/payments/**     @<org>/payments-team @<org>/security-leads
#   /api/auth/**         @<org>/security-team
#   /api/kyc/**          @<org>/compliance-team
#   /api/crypto/**       @<org>/security-team

# Audit role auto-watch (parallel · observer · non-required in production setup):
#   /api/payments/**     @<org>/security-audit
#   /api/auth/**         @<org>/security-audit
#   /api/kyc/**          @<org>/security-audit
#   /api/crypto/**       @<org>/security-audit

# ---------- Tier 4 paths (migrations on payment tables · IAM · CI) ----------
/migrations/**           @kenny-techsolution
/.github/workflows/**    @kenny-techsolution
/infra/iam/**            @kenny-techsolution

# ---------- Tier 2 paths (business logic · non-PCI backend) ----------
# In production: @<org>/backend-team would gate; left unowned in the demo
# so the reviewer's COMMENT-tier behavior is what showcases T2 handling.
# /api/orders/**         @<org>/backend-team
# /api/notifications/**  @<org>/backend-team
# /api/users/**          @<org>/backend-team
# /api/inventory/**      @<org>/backend-team
# /api/menu/**           @<org>/backend-team
# /api/reporting/**      @<org>/backend-team
# /api/reports/**        @<org>/backend-team

# ---------- Tier 1 paths (frontend · non-payment UI) ----------
# /web/src/components/** @<org>/frontend-team
# /web/src/pages/**      @<org>/frontend-team
# /web/src/hooks/**      @<org>/frontend-team

# ---------- Tier 0 paths (docs · tests · styles) ----------
# (intentionally no required reviewer — falls through to repo default)
